pageType: final
background:
  type: gradient
  gradientType: linear
  angle: 135
  stops:
    - {position: 0, color: "#26233F"}
    - {position: 1, color: "#3D3580"}
elements:
  - elementId: deco-circle
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [740, 584, 110, 110]
    shapeName: ellipse
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#FFFFFF08"}
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [90, 120, 500, 24]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
      color: "#B9B4E0"
      letterSpacing: 4
      wrap: false
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 结语 · KEY TAKEAWAY
  - elementId: quote-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [90, 164, 64, 5]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$accent"}
  - elementId: quote
    elementType: text
    bounds: [90, 196, 640, 240]
    content:
      fontSize: 25
      fontFamily: "alimamashuheiti"
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      lineHeight: 1.65
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>「Chat API 暴露模型的『说话能力』；下一代 Agent API 暴露的，是模型在一个受控世界中持续工作、恢复状态、调用能力并交付可验证结果的能力。」</p>
