    elementType: text
    bounds: [90, 456, 620, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
      color: "#CFCAE8"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, top]
      text: 接口设计不再只是工程兼容问题——它直接决定模型在长程任务中的有效能力、Token 消耗和可靠性。
  - elementId: footer-note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [90, 640, 640, 22]
    content: {fontSize: 13, fontFamily: "MiSans", color: "#8F8AB0", wrap: false, align: [left, middle], text: 配套：同名 HTML 交互讲义（含自测题与一页纸总结）· 2026-08}
